{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118090402651-1118_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261118093409\"/><p>APEC工商領導人峰會於深圳前海國際會議中心舉行。</p><p>2026年亞太經合組織（APEC）工商領導人峰會周三（18日）於廣東深圳前海國際會議中心舉行開幕式，中國國家主席習近平將發表主旨演講。今年是中國相隔12年再擔任APEC東道主，大會將以倡議形式提出成果，是峰會創辦30年來首次。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.109802+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T01:04:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T01:37:02.265340+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:37:02.265340+00:00","content_hash":"a7fe7e75b900e0164ad7656506153d80b10f39b2440b908bdbc89cfe3b0e05c5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}